category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gettext-devel libpcre2-devel libps-devel perl python3-devel swig
sdesc: "Free C library to read and write DWG files (utilities)"
ldesc: "GNU LibreDWG is a free C library to handle DWG files. It aims to be a free
replacement for the OpenDWG libraries. DWG is the native file format of
AutoCAD."
skip:

homepage: https://www.gnu.org/software/libredwg/
license: GPL-3.0-or-later AND MIT
